      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192112889.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192112889.png" 
             alt="" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p><strong>BUUCTF: <a href="https://buuoj.cn/challenges"target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://buuoj.cn/challenges</a></strong></p>
<hr>
<p>相关阅读
<a href="https://ctf-wiki.org/"target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CTF Wiki</a></p>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192114943.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192114943.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<h3 id="题目描述">题目描述：</h3>
<p>得到的 flag 请包上 flag{} 提交。(最后提交形式为flag{xxx})</p>
<h3 id="密文">密文：</h3>
<hr>
<h3 id="解题思路">解题思路：</h3>
<p>1、下载文件，我这里直接在网页打开了，选择“另存为”保存文件。

<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192116520.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192116520.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p>图片无法正常显示，再加上题目的提示“fileheader”，初步猜测文件头损坏。使用010 Editor打开，发现文件头缺失，文件尾对应png文件尾（AE 42 60 82），确认为png文件。</p>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl">PNG <span class="o">(</span>png<span class="o">)</span>　　 文件头：89 <span class="m">50</span> 4E 47　　　　　文件尾：AE <span class="m">42</span> <span class="m">60</span> <span class="m">82</span>
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192118149.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192118149.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p>2、给文件添加缺失的png文件头（89 50 4E 47），新的文件头替换掉原来的空文件头（00 00 00 00）

<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192120099.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192120099.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p>保存并查看，得到flag。

<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192122051.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192122051.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<h3 id="flag">flag：</h3>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl">flag<span class="o">{</span>3lit3_h4ck3r<span class="o">}</span>
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div>]]></content:encoded>
